# Boundary Cases

<Prompt Tuning Orthogonal Paradigm>

(1) [Input Not Weights]: Prompt/prefix tuning modifies the input embedding
    space rather than weight matrices. At T5-XXL scale, it matches full FT
    with 0.01% params. #assumption
